<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Verificación | NI Inc</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="images/IconPage.jpg" type="image/x-icon">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <script src="https://js.hcaptcha.com/1/api.js" async defer></script>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #0f0f0f, #000000);
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      animation: fadeIn 1s ease;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #00c3ff;
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px #00c3ff;
      font-size: 2.2em;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.1em;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      line-height: 1.5em;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background: #00c3ff;
      color: black;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      font-size: 1em;
      transition: background 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .btn.active {
      cursor: pointer;
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .btn.active:hover {
      background: #00a0cc;
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .h-captcha {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
      h1 {
        font-size: 1.8em;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 1em;
      }
      .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Verificación de seguridad</h1>
  <p>¿Eres humano? Solo necesitamos comprobarlo antes de darte acceso a las descargas.</p>

  <form id="captchaForm">
    <div class="h-captcha" data-sitekey="0a5044fa-296e-4556-99b6-f7fefc6cd23c" data-callback="onVerified"></div>
    <button type="submit" class="btn" id="continuarBtn" disabled>Continuar</button>
  </form>

<footer style="position: fixed; bottom: 10px; width: 100%; text-align: center; font-size: 0.9em; color: #888;">
  🔒 Esta página está protegida con <strong>hCaptcha</strong> para garantizar que solo usuarios reales accedan al contenido.  
  Tu interacción ayuda a mantener la seguridad y estabilidad del sistema.
</footer>
  
  <script>
    function onVerified(token) {
      const btn = document.getElementById("continuarBtn");
      btn.disabled = false;
      btn.classList.add("active");
    }

    document.getElementById("captchaForm").addEventListener("submit", function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      window.location.href = "descarga.html";
    });
  </script>

  <script>
  fetch("https://vpnapi.io/api/?key=TU_API_KEY")
    .then(response => response.json())
    .then(data => {
      if (data.security && data.security.vpn === true) {
        alert("Acceso denegado: se detectó uso de VPN.");
        window.location.href = "https://www.google.com";
      }
    })
    .catch(error => {
      console.warn("No se pudo verificar VPN:", error);
    });
  </script>

<video autoplay loop playsinline style="position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; z-index: -2;" id="bgVideo">
  <source src="videos/Fondo2.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  Tu navegador no soporta video HTML5.
</video>

<audio autoplay loop>
  <source src="audio/Doukashiteru.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
  Tu navegador no soporta audio HTML5.
</audio>
  
</body>
</html>
